## plan
- set up a new nestjs project and install necessary dependencies (`multer` for file uploads).
- create a controller (`app.controller.ts`) with a post endpoint `/concatenate` to handle file uploads.
- define a service (`app.service.ts`) that will execute the `pdfunite` command to concatenate the uploaded pdf files.
- implement error handling in the service to manage scenarios like invalid input or processing errors.
